From 243dfa6df183eafcc092f9812ebcbd9da2d3b98e000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrik Torstensson <patrik.torstensson@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 04 Sep 2026 11:39:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [Bugfix] Seed align-mode Mamba state_idx in Mamba blocks
 (#53798)

Version-locked to VLLM_REF=v0.29.0. Upstream PR #53798
(https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/53798) open as of 2026-09-09,
not in any tag (v0.29.0, v0.29.0rc6). Drop when VLLM_REF contains the fix.

Adapted for v0.29.0: v0.29.0's MambaHybridModelState still seeds
add_request with cache_config.block_size and lazily resolves Mamba groups
via get_mamba_groups; this backport adds ModelState.set_kv_cache_config
no-op hook, makes GPUModelRunner.initialize_kv_cache bind the config before
any add_request, and refactors MambaHybridModelState to resolve Mamba groups
once at init and seed add_request with MambaSpec.block_size instead of
cache_config.block_size (align table is indexed in Mamba blocks; page
unification can scale it past scheduler block -> wrong column or IMA in
precopy_mamba_align_fused_kernel). Core runtime fix identical to upstream
commit 243dfa6 on branch fix-mamba-align-resume-seed.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
